# KiCad schematic wiring

- Route **orthogonal connections only** (horizontal/vertical). Avoid diagonal wires.
- Use consistent right-angle corners (prefer explicit wire segments instead of “almost straight” angles).
- Add junction dots where needed; don’t rely on overlapping graphics to imply connectivity.

